{"version":1,"content":"<p>前日本AV女優濱崎真緒日前在港疑遭落藥迷暈，依家已正式復工，點知仍頭頭碰着黑，尋日（24日）佢發文，指佢乘搭航班回香港遇到「機艙老鼠」，發現佢放行李架上嘅手背包被人偷竊，偷走當中成個首飾盒及手錶，事後佢已到荃灣報案。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&amp;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T02:23:55.470841+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T01:45:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T02:17:14.134725+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T02:17:14.134725+00:00","content_hash":"0a50e89db4834a0d6c0cdab1db091448637ce9bf6ec03d0762fe500befbe81ef","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}